Show what a function calls

Usage:
  eshu analyze calls <function> [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string       API key for authentication
      --depth int            Maximum traversal depth for transitive callees (default 5)
  -h, --help                 help for calls
      --profile string       Config profile name
      --repo string          Optional repository selector (ID, name, slug, or path)
      --repo-id string       Optional repository ID filter
      --service-url string   API service URL (overrides config)
      --transitive           Include transitive callees

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
